  "dateAssessment": "The absolute dates remain unresolved. Within the YAML’s June 1–4, 1748 span, the three played days can occupy June 1–3 or June 2–4; the windows below preserve these linked alternatives, not independent choices for each row. Session 29 plans departure the next morning (u2688 and u2775–u2778) and closes at sunset before sleep (u3489–u3490); Session 30 opens at dawn (u0004–u0007). This handoff supports an intervening night but supplies no independent absolute date. The separate Session 30 timeline assigns June 2–4; it does not resolve the owning time extraction’s open boundary. That extraction remains compatible, not matched, with two explicit overnight transitions and an unresolved relationship to the YAML start. The final camp clock is about 1:30–2 p.m., despite “evening” in the session note. Cumulative boulder clocks overlap the flight, rescue, and exploration; they are not added as separate elapsed intervals. The final chair transformation begins after camp arrival; its ending watch is open.",
